<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>HERD — How To Guides</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600&family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tabler/icons-webfont@latest/tabler-icons.min.css">
<style>
  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  :root {
    --bg: #F5F4F0;
    --surface: #FFFFFF;
    --surface-raised: #FAFAF8;
    --border: rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    --border-strong: rgba(0,0,0,0.14);
    --text-primary: #1A1A18;
    --text-secondary: #6B6B66;
    --text-muted: #9E9E98;
    --accent: #2D5A3D;
    --accent-light: #EBF2EE;
    --accent-mid: #7BAF90;
    --warn-bg: #FFF8EC;
    --warn-text: #8A5C00;
    --warn-border: rgba(138,92,0,0.2);
    --danger-bg: #FFF0F0;
    --danger-text: #8A2020;
    --danger-border: rgba(138,32,32,0.2);
    --info-bg: #EEF4FF;
    --info-text: #1E3FAA;
    --info-border: rgba(30,63,170,0.2);
    --success-bg: #EDFAF3;
    --success-text: #1A6B40;
    --success-border: rgba(26,107,64,0.2);
    --radius: 10px;
    --radius-sm: 6px;
  }

  body {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    min-height: 100vh;
  }

  /* ── HEADER ── */
  .site-header {
    background: var(--accent);
    padding: 0 2rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    height: 56px;
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 100;
  }
  .site-header .logo {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .site-header .logo-icon {
    width: 28px; height: 28px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
    border-radius: 6px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-size: 14px; color: #fff;
  }
  .site-header .tagline {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    text-transform: none;
  }

  /* ── LAYOUT ── */
  .layout {
    display: flex;
    min-height: calc(100vh - 56px);
  }

  /* ── SIDEBAR ── */
  .sidebar {
    width: 240px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    background: var(--surface);
    border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 1.5rem 0;
    position: sticky;
    top: 56px;
    height: calc(100vh - 56px);
    overflow-y: auto;
  }
  .sidebar-section {
    padding: 0 1rem 1rem;
  }
  .sidebar-label {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    padding: 0 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .sidebar-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 7px 12px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.15s;
    border: none;
    background: none;
    width: 100%;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .sidebar-item i { font-size: 15px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .sidebar-item:hover { background: var(--surface-raised); color: var(--text-primary); }
  .sidebar-item.active { background: var(--accent-light); color: var(--accent); font-weight: 500; }
  .sidebar-item.active i { color: var(--accent); }
  .sidebar-divider { height: 1px; background: var(--border); margin: 0.75rem 1rem; }

  /* ── MAIN ── */
  .main {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 2rem 2.5rem;
    max-width: 820px;
  }

  /* ── GUIDE ── */
  .guide { display: none; }
  .guide.active { display: block; }

  .guide-header {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    padding-bottom: 1.25rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .guide-eyebrow {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .guide-title {
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    line-height: 1.25;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .guide-desc {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* ── TABS ── */
  .tabs {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  .tab-btn {
    padding: 9px 16px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    cursor: pointer;
    border: none;
    border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
    margin-bottom: -1px;
    background: none;
    white-space: nowrap;
    transition: color 0.15s, border-color 0.15s;
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
  }
  .tab-btn:hover { color: var(--text-primary); }
  .tab-btn.active { color: var(--accent); border-bottom-color: var(--accent); }
  .tab-panel { display: none; }
  .tab-panel.active { display: block; }

  /* ── COMPONENTS ── */
  .step {
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
  }
  .step-num {
    width: 28px; height: 28px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--surface-raised);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 1px;
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
  }
  .step-num.accent { background: var(--accent-light); color: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent-mid); }
  .step-body { flex: 1; }
  .step-label { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .step-desc { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.55; }

  .rule-card {
    display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: flex-start;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .rule-card i { font-size: 18px; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 1px; }
  .rule-title { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 3px; }
  .rule-desc { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.5; }

  .field-card {
    padding: 14px 16px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .field-name { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 4px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
  .field-guidance { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.55; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .field-example { font-size: 12px; font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; color: var(--text-primary); padding: 8px 10px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); background: var(--surface-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border); line-height: 1.6; }

  .badge { display: inline-block; font-size: 11px; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 20px; margin-left: 6px; font-weight: 500; }
  .badge-warn { background: var(--warn-bg); color: var(--warn-text); }
  .badge-info { background: var(--info-bg); color: var(--info-text); }
  .badge-success { background: var(--success-bg); color: var(--success-text); }
  .badge-danger { background: var(--danger-bg); color: var(--danger-text); }

  .tip { font-size: 12px; color: var(--info-text); margin-top: 6px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 5px; }
  .tip i { flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 1px; font-size: 13px; }
  .warn-inline { font-size: 12px; color: var(--warn-text); margin-top: 6px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 5px; }
  .warn-inline i { flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 1px; font-size: 13px; }

  .callout {
    padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: var(--radius);
    font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.55; margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .callout-warn { background: var(--warn-bg); border: 1px solid var(--warn-border); color: var(--warn-text); }
  .callout-danger { background: var(--danger-bg); border: 1px solid var(--danger-border); color: var(--danger-text); }
  .callout-info { background: var(--info-bg); border: 1px solid var(--info-border); color: var(--info-text); }
  .callout-success { background: var(--success-bg); border: 1px solid var(--success-border); color: var(--success-text); }
  .callout strong { font-weight: 600; display: block; margin-bottom: 3px; }

  .channel-box {
    padding: 12px 16px;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--info-text);
    border-radius: 0 var(--radius-sm) var(--radius-sm) 0;
    background: var(--info-bg);
    margin: 10px 0;
  }
  .channel-label { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: var(--info-text); margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .channel-text { font-size: 12px; font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; color: var(--text-primary); line-height: 1.6; }

  .prompt-box {
    padding: 14px 16px; border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--surface-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-primary); line-height: 1.7; white-space: pre-wrap;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .checklist-item {
    display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: flex-start;
    padding: 10px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .checklist-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .checklist-item i { font-size: 16px; color: var(--text-muted); flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 1px; }
  .check-label { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-primary); }
  .check-desc { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-top: 2px; line-height: 1.45; }

  .section-card {
    padding: 14px 16px; background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius); margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .section-name { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 4px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
  .section-guidance { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.55; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .do-box { padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); background: var(--success-bg); border: 1px solid var(--success-border); font-size: 12px; color: var(--success-text); line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 6px; }
  .avoid-box { padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); background: var(--danger-bg); border: 1px solid var(--danger-border); font-size: 12px; color: var(--danger-text); line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 6px; }
  .mono-box { padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); background: var(--surface-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border); font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-primary); line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 6px; }

  .divider { height: 1px; background: var(--border); margin: 1.25rem 0; }

  .section-heading { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .section-sub { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  .section-title { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 4px; }

  .grid-2 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 8px; }
  .grid-3 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 8px; }
  .quality-pill { padding: 10px 12px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius); background: var(--surface); text-align: center; }
  .quality-pill i { font-size: 20px; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .quality-pill .qp-name { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-primary); }
  .quality-pill .qp-desc { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-top: 2px; }

  .review-flow { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 12px 0; }
  .review-step { padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 20px; background: var(--surface-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-primary); }
  .review-step.mandatory { background: var(--info-bg); border-color: var(--info-border); color: var(--info-text); }
  .review-arrow { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); }

  .status-badge { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; border: 1px solid var(--border); background: var(--surface-raised); margin: 2px; }
  .dot { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; flex-shrink: 0; }

  .doc-type-card { padding: 14px 16px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius); background: var(--surface); margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .doc-type-label { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .doc-type-title { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .doc-type-items { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.65; }

  .req-badge { font-size: 10px; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 10px; font-weight: 500; }
  .req-yes { background: var(--danger-bg); color: var(--danger-text); }
  .req-note { background: var(--warn-bg); color: var(--warn-text); }

  /* ── HOME ── */
  .home-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
  .home-card {
    padding: 20px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: border-color 0.15s, box-shadow 0.15s;
  }
  .home-card:hover { border-color: var(--accent-mid); box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(45,90,61,0.08); }
  .home-card-icon { font-size: 22px; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .home-card-cat { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.07em; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .home-card-title { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .home-card-desc { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.5; }
  .home-card-arrow { font-size: 12px; color: var(--accent); margin-top: 10px; display: block; }

  .home-intro { padding: 20px; background: var(--accent); border-radius: var(--radius); color: #fff; margin-bottom: 0; }
  .home-intro h2 { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .home-intro p { font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); line-height: 1.6; }
  .herd-logo-large { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); margin-bottom: 8px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="site-header">
  <div class="logo">
    <div class="logo-icon"><i class="ti ti-layout-grid"></i></div>
    HERD
    <span class="tagline">Hub for Execution, Releases and Delivery</span>
  </div>
  <div style="font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.45)">How To Guides</div>
</header>

<div class="layout">

  <!-- SIDEBAR -->
  <nav class="sidebar">
    <div class="sidebar-section">
      <div class="sidebar-label">Getting started</div>
      <button class="sidebar-item active" onclick="showGuide('home')">
        <i class="ti ti-home"></i> Home
      </button>
    </div>
    <div class="sidebar-divider"></div>
    <div class="sidebar-section">
      <div class="sidebar-label">Product documentation</div>
      <button class="sidebar-item" onclick="showGuide('doc-process')">
        <i class="ti ti-sitemap"></i> Documentation process
      </button>
      <button class="sidebar-item" onclick="showGuide('doc-claude')">
        <i class="ti ti-sparkles"></i> Create docs using Claude
      </button>
    </div>
    <div class="sidebar-divider"></div>
    <div class="sidebar-section">
      <div class="sidebar-label">Release notes</div>
      <button class="sidebar-item" onclick="showGuide('rn-process')">
        <i class="ti ti-git-branch"></i> Release note process
      </button>
      <button class="sidebar-item" onclick="showGuide('rn-write')">
        <i class="ti ti-pencil"></i> Write a release note
      </button>
    </div>
    <div class="sidebar-divider"></div>
    <div class="sidebar-section">
      <div class="sidebar-label">Exceptions</div>
      <button class="sidebar-item" onclick="showGuide('ex-process')">
        <i class="ti ti-alert-circle"></i> Exception creation
      </button>
      <button class="sidebar-item" onclick="showGuide('ex-template')">
        <i class="ti ti-file-description"></i> Fill the template
      </button>
    </div>
    <div class="sidebar-divider"></div>
    <div class="sidebar-section">
      <div class="sidebar-label">Planning</div>
      <button class="sidebar-item" onclick="showGuide('calendar')">
        <i class="ti ti-calendar-event"></i> Release calendar
      </button>
    </div>
    <div class="sidebar-divider"></div>
    <div class="sidebar-section">
      <div class="sidebar-label">Tools</div>
      <button class="sidebar-item" onclick="showGuide('claude-code')">
        <i class="ti ti-terminal-2"></i> Installing Claude Code
      </button>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- MAIN -->
  <main class="main">

    <!-- HOME -->
    <div class="guide active" id="guide-home">
      <div class="home-intro">
        <div class="herd-logo-large">HERD</div>
        <h2>How To Guides</h2>
        <p>Everything you need to get product documentation, release notes, and exceptions created and published — in one place.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="home-grid">
        <div class="home-card" onclick="showGuide('doc-process')">
          <div class="home-card-icon"><i class="ti ti-sitemap"></i></div>
          <div class="home-card-cat">Product documentation</div>
          <div class="home-card-title">Documentation process</div>
          <div class="home-card-desc">End-to-end process for getting capability and module docs published on docs.kaluza.com</div>
          <span class="home-card-arrow">Open guide →</span>
        </div>
        <div class="home-card" onclick="showGuide('doc-claude')">
          <div class="home-card-icon"><i class="ti ti-sparkles"></i></div>
          <div class="home-card-cat">Product documentation</div>
          <div class="home-card-title">Create docs using Claude</div>
          <div class="home-card-desc">Using the /product-documentation skill to draft capability docs ready for tech writer review</div>
          <span class="home-card-arrow">Open guide →</span>
        </div>
        <div class="home-card" onclick="showGuide('rn-process')">
          <div class="home-card-icon"><i class="ti ti-git-branch"></i></div>
          <div class="home-card-cat">Release notes</div>
          <div class="home-card-title">Release note process</div>
          <div class="home-card-desc">End-to-end process for getting a release note drafted, reviewed, and published</div>
          <span class="home-card-arrow">Open guide →</span>
        </div>
        <div class="home-card" onclick="showGuide('rn-write')">
          <div class="home-card-icon"><i class="ti ti-pencil"></i></div>
          <div class="home-card-cat">Release notes</div>
          <div class="home-card-title">Write a release note</div>
          <div class="home-card-desc">What goes in each section, how to write it, and what to avoid</div>
          <span class="home-card-arrow">Open guide →</span>
        </div>
        <div class="home-card" onclick="showGuide('ex-process')">
          <div class="home-card-icon"><i class="ti ti-alert-circle"></i></div>
          <div class="home-card-cat">Exceptions</div>
          <div class="home-card-title">Exception creation</div>
          <div class="home-card-desc">Your end-to-end responsibilities from identifying a new exception through to ongoing quality</div>
          <span class="home-card-arrow">Open guide →</span>
        </div>
        <div class="home-card" onclick="showGuide('ex-template')">
          <div class="home-card-icon"><i class="ti ti-file-description"></i></div>
          <div class="home-card-cat">Exceptions</div>
          <div class="home-card-title">Fill the exception template</div>
          <div class="home-card-desc">What goes in each field and how to write a path to resolution that passes review first time</div>
          <span class="home-card-arrow">Open guide →</span>
        </div>
        <div class="home-card" onclick="showGuide('calendar')">
          <div class="home-card-icon"><i class="ti ti-calendar-event"></i></div>
          <div class="home-card-cat">Planning</div>
          <div class="home-card-title">Release calendar</div>
          <div class="home-card-desc">Upcoming AGL and SEA release dates with product doc and release note deadlines calculated automatically</div>
          <span class="home-card-arrow">Open guide →</span>
        </div>
        <div class="home-card" onclick="showGuide('claude-code')">
          <div class="home-card-icon"><i class="ti ti-terminal-2"></i></div>
          <div class="home-card-cat">Tools</div>
          <div class="home-card-title">Installing Claude Code on Mac</div>
          <div class="home-card-desc">Set up Homebrew, Git, GitHub, and Claude Code on your Mac step by step</div>
          <span class="home-card-arrow">Open guide →</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- CLAUDE CODE -->
    <div class="guide" id="guide-claude-code">
      <div class="guide-header">
        <div class="guide-eyebrow">Tools</div>
        <div class="guide-title">How to: install Claude Code on Mac</div>
        <div class="guide-desc">Set up everything you need to run Claude Code on your Mac — Homebrew, Git, GitHub, and your first repository</div>
      </div>
      <div class="tabs">
        <button class="tab-btn active" onclick="switchTab(this,'cc')">Before you start</button>
        <button class="tab-btn" onclick="switchTab(this,'cc')">Part 1: Homebrew</button>
        <button class="tab-btn" onclick="switchTab(this,'cc')">Part 2: Git</button>
        <button class="tab-btn" onclick="switchTab(this,'cc')">Part 3: GitHub</button>
        <button class="tab-btn" onclick="switchTab(this,'cc')">Part 4: Download a repo</button>
        <button class="tab-btn" onclick="switchTab(this,'cc')">Keeping up to date</button>
      </div>

      <div class="tab-panel active" id="cc-0">
        <p class="section-title">Before you start</p>
        <p class="section-sub">Have these ready before you begin.</p>
        <div style="border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);overflow:hidden">
          <div class="checklist-item"><i class="ti ti-circle-1"></i><div><div class="check-label">A GitHub account</div><div class="check-desc">Create one at github.com if you don't have one — it's free</div></div></div>
          <div class="checklist-item"><i class="ti ti-circle-2"></i><div><div class="check-label">A Projects folder on your Mac</div><div class="check-desc">Create a folder somewhere easy to find, like Documents, and call it <code style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;background:var(--surface-raised);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid var(--border)">Projects</code></div></div></div>
          <div class="checklist-item"><i class="ti ti-circle-3"></i><div><div class="check-label">Admin on Demand access</div><div class="check-desc">You'll need this twice — once for Homebrew and once for Git</div></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="tab-panel" id="cc-1">
        <p class="section-title">Part 1: Install Homebrew</p>
        <p class="section-sub">Homebrew is a tool that lets you install developer software from the terminal.</p>
        <div class="step"><div class="step-num">1</div><div class="step-body"><div class="step-label">Open Terminal</div><div class="step-desc">Press <strong>Cmd + Space</strong>, type <em>Terminal</em>, and hit Enter.</div></div></div>
        <div class="step"><div class="step-num">2</div><div class="step-body"><div class="step-label">Get the install command</div><div class="step-desc">Go to <strong>brew.sh</strong> and copy the install command shown on the page.</div></div></div>
        <div class="step"><div class="step-num">3</div><div class="step-body"><div class="step-label">Activate Admin on Demand and run the command</div><div class="step-desc">Activate <strong>Admin on Demand</strong>, then paste and run the command in Terminal. Enter your password when prompted and hit <strong>Enter</strong>.</div></div></div>
        <div class="step"><div class="step-num">4</div><div class="step-body"><div class="step-label">Run the three follow-up commands</div><div class="step-desc">When Homebrew finishes it will show you three commands to run (the <code style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;background:var(--surface-raised);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid var(--border)">echo</code>, <code style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;background:var(--surface-raised);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid var(--border)">echo</code>, and <code style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;background:var(--surface-raised);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid var(--border)">eval</code> lines). Run each one.</div></div></div>
        <div class="step"><div class="step-num">5</div><div class="step-body"><div class="step-label">Confirm Homebrew is installed</div><div class="step-desc">Run the following — you should see a version number returned.</div><div class="field-example" style="margin-top:8px">brew -v</div></div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="tab-panel" id="cc-2">
        <p class="section-title">Part 2: Install Git</p>
        <p class="section-sub">Git is the tool that lets you download and sync code from GitHub.</p>
        <div class="step"><div class="step-num">1</div><div class="step-body"><div class="step-label">Re-up Admin on Demand if needed</div><div class="step-desc">Check Admin on Demand hasn't expired before running the next step.</div></div></div>
        <div class="step"><div class="step-num">2</div><div class="step-body"><div class="step-label">Install Git</div><div class="step-desc">In Terminal, run:</div><div class="field-example" style="margin-top:8px">brew install git</div></div></div>
        <div class="step"><div class="step-num">3</div><div class="step-body"><div class="step-label">Confirm Git is installed</div><div class="step-desc">Wait for it to finish, then run:</div><div class="field-example" style="margin-top:8px">git -v</div></div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="tab-panel" id="cc-3">
        <p class="section-title">Part 3: Connect to GitHub</p>
        <p class="section-sub">This links your Terminal to your GitHub account so you can download repositories.</p>
        <div class="step"><div class="step-num">1</div><div class="step-body"><div class="step-label">Install the GitHub CLI</div><div class="step-desc">In Terminal, run:</div><div class="field-example" style="margin-top:8px">brew install gh</div></div></div>
        <div class="step"><div class="step-num">2</div><div class="step-body"><div class="step-label">Log in to GitHub</div><div class="step-desc">Once installed, run:</div><div class="field-example" style="margin-top:8px">gh auth login</div></div></div>
        <div class="step"><div class="step-num">3</div><div class="step-body"><div class="step-label">Follow the prompts</div><div class="step-desc">Choose to log in <strong>via the website</strong> using <strong>HTTPS</strong>. Terminal will display a code — click the GitHub link that Terminal shows and enter the code on that page.</div></div></div>
        <div class="step"><div class="step-num">4</div><div class="step-body"><div class="step-label">Return to Terminal once confirmed</div><div class="step-desc">Once GitHub confirms the login, return to Terminal — you're connected.</div></div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="tab-panel" id="cc-4">
        <p class="section-title">Part 4: Download a repository</p>
        <p class="section-sub">Do this whenever you want to pull a codebase down to your Mac to work with.</p>
        <div class="step"><div class="step-num">1</div><div class="step-body"><div class="step-label">Open Terminal in your Projects folder</div><div class="step-desc">In <strong>Finder</strong>, navigate to your <code style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;background:var(--surface-raised);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid var(--border)">Projects</code> folder, right-click it, and select <strong>New Terminal at Folder</strong>.</div></div></div>
        <div class="step"><div class="step-num">2</div><div class="step-body"><div class="step-label">Copy the repo link from GitHub</div><div class="step-desc">Go to the repo on <strong>github.com</strong>, click the green <strong>Code</strong> button, and copy the <strong>HTTPS</strong> link.</div></div></div>
        <div class="step"><div class="step-num">3</div><div class="step-body"><div class="step-label">Clone the repo</div><div class="step-desc">In Terminal, run:</div><div class="field-example" style="margin-top:8px">git clone [paste the link here]</div><div class="step-desc" style="margin-top:6px">This will create a new folder inside <code style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;background:var(--surface-raised);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid var(--border)">Projects</code> containing the repo.</div></div></div>
        <div class="step"><div class="step-num">4</div><div class="step-body"><div class="step-label">Point Claude Code at the folder</div><div class="step-desc">You can now open Claude Code and point it at that folder to start working with the code.</div></div></div>
        <div class="callout callout-info" style="margin-top:1rem"><strong>Tip</strong> You can also ask Claude Code to do this for you — just tell it which repo you want and it will handle the clone without you needing to run the Terminal command yourself.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="tab-panel" id="cc-5">
        <p class="section-title">Keeping your repo up to date</p>
        <p class="section-sub">If changes have been made to the repo on GitHub by colleagues, pull the latest version.</p>
        <div class="step"><div class="step-num">1</div><div class="step-body"><div class="step-label">Open Terminal inside the repo folder</div><div class="step-desc">In Finder, navigate into your repo folder (inside <code style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;background:var(--surface-raised);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid var(--border)">Projects</code>), right-click, and select <strong>New Terminal at Folder</strong>.</div></div></div>
        <div class="step"><div class="step-num">2</div><div class="step-body"><div class="step-label">Pull the latest changes</div><div class="step-desc">Run:</div><div class="field-example" style="margin-top:8px">git pull</div></div></div>
        <div class="callout callout-info" style="margin-top:1rem"><strong>Tip</strong> You can also just ask Claude Code directly — try <em>"is my local repo up to date?"</em> and it will work it out for you. Or ask <em>"what's changed, write a brief summary"</em> to get a quick overview of recent updates without running any commands yourself.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

